# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:454 ../effects.rst:1240
msgid "softness"
msgstr "softness"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:454
msgid ""
"``(float, 0–1)`` **Luma softness.** Small horizontal blur on Y (approx. 0–2 "
"px). Keep low to retain detail when noise is high."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0–1)`` **Размытие яркости.** Небольшое горизонтальное размытие по "
